  "details": "Specifically for searching worlds on the website, I want to sort worlds by download size because I want to visit massively detailed places where everything is ultra high resolution.\nIf the ability to sort worlds by size were an option, world builders would have more incentive to work on one world instead of dozens for knowing that those looking for detailed worlds can find it.\nIf I recall correctly, the most detailed world I attended was 5GB and took several minutes to load.  Although some would consider the loading time a chore, once such a world is cached, I would plan to return to it often.",
